{%- comment -%}
  SEO copy block — site-structure.md §8.5: "פרחים בחיפה / משלוחי פרחים בחיפה
  והסביבה". The paragraph is the owner's own wording (2026-09-12, proofread by the
  mayan-copy-writer agent): shop type, street address, what the shop sells,
  delivery areas. Deliberately no hours, cutoffs or weekday names here; those
  live on /pages/delivery and in the cart scheduler. Each head term appears
  once, in prose, per seo-geo-haifa.

  `פרחים בחיפה` appears here and only here — CLAUDE.md settles the homepage
  as the page that owns that term, so no collection or content page should
  repeat it as their own heading.

  Photo added 2026-08-21, swapped the same day for the owner's pick (`iimages to
  use/Haifa view.jpg`, 1856×2304 portrait): a Florista bouquet on a Carmel
  balcony over Haifa bay and the port. It beats the German Colony shot it
  replaced because the flowers and the city are in one frame — the section
  claims "we are a Haifa flower shop", and this photo shows both halves of
  that claim rather than a landmark alone.

  Re-cropped 1:1 the same day, on the owner's note that the first pass cut too
  much: `-crop 1856x1856+0+448`, anchored to the bottom of the frame so the
  whole laid table reads — the linen cloth, the wine bottle in the ice bucket,
  and the vase down to its base. A 3:2 crop cannot hold both the table and the
  sea; 5:4 keeps the table but loses the bay entirely, which would strip the
  Haifa half of the claim out of the photo. Square keeps both, and squares up
  the desktop two-column row instead of towering over the four-line text
  block the way the full 4:5 frame would. Derivatives:
  `haifa-view-{480,768,1024,1536}.{jpg,webp}`.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'florista-seo-copy.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="seo-section">
  <div class="seo-inner">
    <div class="seo-media">
      <picture>
        <source
          type="image/webp"
          srcset="
            {{ 'haifa-view-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w,
            {{ 'haifa-view-768.webp' | asset_url }} 768w,
            {{ 'haifa-view-1024.webp' | asset_url }} 1024w,
            {{ 'haifa-view-1536.webp' | asset_url }} 1536w
          "
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 40vw, 100vw"
        >
        <img
          src="{{ 'haifa-view-1024.jpg' | asset_url }}"
          srcset="
            {{ 'haifa-view-480.jpg' | asset_url }} 480w,
            {{ 'haifa-view-768.jpg' | asset_url }} 768w,
            {{ 'haifa-view-1024.jpg' | asset_url }} 1024w,
            {{ 'haifa-view-1536.jpg' | asset_url }} 1536w
          "
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 40vw, 100vw"
          alt="זר פרחים של פלוריסטה על מרפסת בהר הכרמל, ונוף למפרץ חיפה ולנמל"
          width="1856"
          height="1856"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      </picture>
    </div>
    <div class="seo-text">
      {%- comment -%}
        This is the homepage's single h1 (the header logo and the hero title
        deliberately are not): the homepage owns פרחים בחיפה, and the delivery
        term rides as the h2 subheading until /delivery exists and owns
        משלוחי פרחים בחיפה outright.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <h1 class="seo-heading">פרחים בחיפה</h1>
      <h2 class="seo-lede">משלוחי פרחים בחיפה והסביבה</h2>
      <p class="seo-body">
        פלוריסטה היא בוטיק פרחים בחיפה. חנות הפרחים שלנו ממוקמת ברחוב חניתה 34 בשכונת נווה שאנן.
        בחנות הפרחים שלנו תוכלו לרכוש זרי פרחים בהתאמה אישית, שוקולדים איכותיים ויין נהדר.
        אנחנו עושים משלוחי פרחים בחיפה, נשר, קריות, טירת הכרמל ועתלית.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Florista SEO copy",
  "presets": [{ "name": "Florista SEO copy" }]
}
{% endschema %}
